# 3. Data Cleaning

## data_cleaning.py

```python
import pandas as pd

orders = pd.read_csv("data/orders.csv")

orders.drop_duplicates(inplace=True)

orders["OrderDate"] = pd.to_datetime(
    orders["OrderDate"]
)

orders["Revenue"] = (
    orders["Quantity"] *
    orders["UnitPrice"]
)

orders.to_csv(
    "data/processed_sales.csv",
    index=False
)

print("Data cleaned successfully")
```

