# 5. KPI Generation

## kpi_generator.py

```python
import pandas as pd

df = pd.read_csv(
    "data/processed_sales.csv"
)

gmv = df["Revenue"].sum()

orders = df["OrderID"].nunique()

customers = df["CustomerID"].nunique()

aov = gmv/orders

kpis = pd.DataFrame({
    "Metric":[
        "GMV",
        "Orders",
        "Customers",
        "AOV"
    ],
    "Value":[
        gmv,
        orders,
        customers,
        aov
    ]
})

kpis.to_csv(
    "outputs/executive_kpis.csv",
    index=False
)
```

