# 7. Advanced KPI SQL

## kpi_queries.sql

### GMV

```sql
SELECT
SUM(Revenue) AS GMV
FROM Sales_Fact;
```

### Category Contribution

```sql
SELECT
Category,
SUM(Revenue) Revenue
FROM Sales_Fact
GROUP BY Category;
```

### Regional Revenue

```sql
SELECT
Region,
SUM(Revenue) Revenue
FROM Sales_Fact
GROUP BY Region;
```

### Top Customers

```sql
SELECT
CustomerID,
SUM(Revenue) Revenue
FROM Sales_Fact
GROUP BY CustomerID
ORDER BY Revenue DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

