# 9. DAX Measures

```DAX
GMV =
SUM(Sales_Fact[Revenue])

Orders =
DISTINCTCOUNT(Sales_Fact[OrderID])

Customers =
DISTINCTCOUNT(Sales_Fact[CustomerID])

AOV =
DIVIDE([GMV],[Orders])

Revenue Growth % =
DIVIDE(
    [GMV]-CALCULATE(
        [GMV],
        PREVIOUSMONTH(Date[Date])
    ),
    CALCULATE(
        [GMV],
        PREVIOUSMONTH(Date[Date])
    )
)
```

